{"step_index":434,"source":"USER_EXPLICIT","type":"USER_INPUT","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-19T08:39:49Z","content":"<USER_REQUEST>\nYOU PASTE IT INTO CLAUDE CODE AND IT SETS UP THE BOT WHILE YOU GRAB A COFFEE \n\nNo programming required. Just paste. A single prompt does it all:\n\nTime required: 1 minute\nActions: copy and paste into Claude Code\n\nThe mistake that wipes out the accounts of 99% of traders with bots: they use the same strategy for everything. But the market isn't the same on a quiet Tuesday as it is in the middle of a crash\n\n→ Read the market like a quant: detect if it's calm, sideways, jittery, or in freefall, and switch strategies for each one\n\n→ Handbrake: maximum drawdown of 15% and a kill switch that's checked before EVERY order\n\n→ Test before touching the money: backtest the strategy period by period with real data and refuse to trade if it doesn't beat the market\n\n→ Night shift: while you sleep, it analyzes what went wrong and leaves ready improvements. You decide if they're applied\n\n→ Zero code: you paste, fill in your data, and Claude handles the rest\n\nBefore, this meant a team of PhDs, thousands of lines of code, and weeks of work. \n</USER_REQUEST>\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\nThe current local time is: 2026-10-19T14:09:49+05:30.\n\nThe user has uploaded 1 image(s):\n- /Users/dev/.gemini/antigravity/brain/fbbefb03-c012-4cd6-882c-39f6295a6918/.user_uploaded/media_1792399183377_cd5dbcd4.png\nYou can embed this image in an artifact if you need the USER to review it.\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>","media":[{"mime_type":"image/png","uri":"/Users/dev/.gemini/antigravity/brain/fbbefb03-c012-4cd6-882c-39f6295a6918/.user_uploaded/media_1792399183377_cd5dbcd4.png"}]}
